DATA-QUALITY: V1 (2.0.0) IS the CVE-2021-28918 fix release (adds the octal-octet parse that closes the
seed); V2 (2.0.1) IS the CVE-2021-29418 fix release (ip2long/atob rewrite). Distinct versions, distinct
commits, distinct fixed_version. original (0177.0.0.1) != residual (0X7f.0.0.1). Seed is closed on V1
yet the residual reaches the flag on V1 (genuine differential), and V1 does NOT block the residual;
V2 closes it. Confirmed incomplete fix. Genuine end-to-end SSRF: the guard admits, undici performs the
real outbound fetch, and the raw string routes to the loopback sidecar (flag only returns on a real
loopback reach, never a mere classification check).

STATUS: gate_passed.
